  <p id="c-nanshi-023-wanghua-heirs:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子定侯<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wanghua-heirs:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABA">嗣</persName>，卒。子<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wanghua-heirs:p001:m0008" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABAA">長</persName>嗣，坐罵母奪爵，以<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wanghua-heirs:p001:m0018" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABAA">長</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wanghua-heirs:p001:m0020" ref="02c_86e_5a9">佟</persName>詔封。齊受禪，國除。</p>
